{"reference_id": "MP015:p0105:LREF01", "page_key": "MP015:p0105", "statement_zh": "FreFlow：作用于法兰的力和扭矩引起泵机组变形。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "The forces and torques acting on the flanges cause deformations in the pump unit. These", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP015:p0105:b0003", "bbox": {"x0": 164.34, "top": 105.66, "x1": 536.235, "bottom": 115.62}}], "source_page_sha256": "924e93bafa38d2e19cf7e2b631c71dd2163ad43e86b133e804234e999685cf4e"}
{"reference_id": "MP015:p0105:LREF02", "page_key": "MP015:p0105", "statement_zh": "泵机组变形表现为泵轴颈相对电机轴颈位移。", "relation": "manifests_as", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 90, "text": "are manifested in a displacement of the shaft journal of the pump in relation to the shaft", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP015:p0105:b0004", "bbox": {"x0": 164.34, "top": 117.66, "x1": 532.818, "bottom": 127.62}}, {"start": 0, "end": 21, "text": "journal of the motor.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP015:p0105:b0005", "bbox": {"x0": 164.34, "top": 129.66, "x1": 514.366, "bottom": 139.62}}], "source_page_sha256": "924e93bafa38d2e19cf7e2b631c71dd2163ad43e86b133e804234e999685cf4e"}
{"reference_id": "MP016:p0012:LREF01", "page_key": "MP016:p0012", "statement_zh": "青铜柔性叶轮泵：因任何原因退回供应商前必须完整清洁并去污；清洁与去污按一个组合目标计。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 56, "text": "Toute pompe retournée au fournisseur pour quelque raison", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0012:b0062", "bbox": {"x0": 27.0, "top": 477.873, "x1": 171.819, "bottom": 484.873}}, {"start": 0, "end": 61, "text": "que ce soit doit être entièrement nettoyée et décontaminée et", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0012:b0064", "bbox": {"x0": 27.0, "top": 486.273, "x1": 177.722, "bottom": 493.273}}], "source_page_sha256": "e97bccdc437e376730de246a79b6f86834765b610bead09030b2c673da618cc3"}
{"reference_id": "MP016:p0012:LREF02", "page_key": "MP016:p0012", "statement_zh": "检查或维护该泵之前，总是隔离并锁定驱动电机。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 61, "text": "Isolez et verrouillez toujours le moteur d’entraînement de la", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0012:b0061", "bbox": {"x0": 207.0, "top": 473.207, "x1": 364.819, "bottom": 480.207}}, {"start": 0, "end": 49, "text": "pompe avant d’inspecter ou d’entretenir la pompe.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0012:b0063", "bbox": {"x0": 207.0, "top": 481.607, "x1": 340.523, "bottom": 488.607}}], "source_page_sha256": "e97bccdc437e376730de246a79b6f86834765b610bead09030b2c673da618cc3"}
{"reference_id": "MP016:p0021:LREF01", "page_key": "MP016:p0021", "statement_zh": "柔性叶轮泵的泵轴与电机轴应严格按联轴器制造商指示对中。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 57, "text": "Pumpen- und Motorwellen müssen exakt nach den Anweisungen", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0044", "bbox": {"x0": 27.0, "top": 279.48, "x1": 186.331, "bottom": 286.48}}, {"start": 0, "end": 45, "text": "des Kupplungsherstellers ausgerichtet werden.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0046", "bbox": {"x0": 27.0, "top": 287.88, "x1": 141.959, "bottom": 294.88}}], "source_page_sha256": "8d114e8e3112ef85392a16ec6a069aeca24a305820d7ed09f443a249edaa00ee"}
{"reference_id": "MP016:p0021:LREF02", "page_key": "MP016:p0021", "statement_zh": "泵共同底板或框架变形可能影响联轴器对中，非确定必然。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 61, "text": "Ausrüstung ohne Vibrationen zu tragen. Eine Verformung könnte", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0056", "bbox": {"x0": 27.0, "top": 340.439, "x1": 185.211, "bottom": 347.439}}, {"start": 0, "end": 45, "text": "die Ausrichtung der Kupplung beeinträchtigen.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0058", "bbox": {"x0": 27.0, "top": 348.839, "x1": 180.605, "bottom": 355.839}}], "source_page_sha256": "8d114e8e3112ef85392a16ec6a069aeca24a305820d7ed09f443a249edaa00ee"}
{"reference_id": "MP016:p0021:LREF03", "page_key": "MP016:p0021", "statement_zh": "安装完成后、泵启动前，始终检查泵与驱动的对中。", "relation": "inspected_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 62, "text": "immer die Ausrichtung von Pumpe und Antrieb nach der Installa-", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0060", "bbox": {"x0": 27.0, "top": 357.239, "x1": 185.756, "bottom": 364.239}}, {"start": 0, "end": 35, "text": "tion und vor dem Starten der Pumpe.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0062", "bbox": {"x0": 27.0, "top": 365.639, "x1": 117.817, "bottom": 372.639}}], "source_page_sha256": "8d114e8e3112ef85392a16ec6a069aeca24a305820d7ed09f443a249edaa00ee"}
{"reference_id": "MP016:p0021:LREF04", "page_key": "MP016:p0021", "statement_zh": "安装时管路布置或尺寸因素改变，应复查泵选型是否仍正确。", "relation": "inspected_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 57, "text": "Sollten beim Einbau der Pumpe irgendwelche Faktoren davon", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0049", "bbox": {"x0": 207.0, "top": 306.391, "x1": 358.421, "bottom": 313.391}}, {"start": 0, "end": 59, "text": "abweichen, müssen Sie überprüfen, ob die Pumpenauswahl noch", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0050", "bbox": {"x0": 207.0, "top": 314.791, "x1": 366.87, "bottom": 321.791}}, {"start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "die richtige ist:", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0052", "bbox": {"x0": 207.0, "top": 323.191, "x1": 243.435, "bottom": 330.191}}], "source_page_sha256": "8d114e8e3112ef85392a16ec6a069aeca24a305820d7ed09f443a249edaa00ee"}
{"reference_id": "MP016:p0021:LREF05", "page_key": "MP016:p0021", "statement_zh": "短管路和大管径用于预防汽蚀，尤其输送黏性液体；可能需比泵接口更大的管径。", "relation": "prevented_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 2, "end": 60, "text": "Sorgen Sie für kurze Rohrlängen und große Rohrdurchmesser;", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0055", "bbox": {"x0": 207.0, "top": 336.091, "x1": 368.079, "bottom": 343.091}}, {"start": 0, "end": 56, "text": "die Pumpenanschlüsse – insbesondere zum Fördern viskoser", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0059", "bbox": {"x0": 216.0, "top": 352.891, "x1": 363.97, "bottom": 359.891}}, {"start": 0, "end": 42, "text": "Flüssigkeiten, um Kavitation zu vermeiden.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0061", "bbox": {"x0": 216.0, "top": 361.291, "x1": 321.279, "bottom": 368.291}}], "source_page_sha256": "8d114e8e3112ef85392a16ec6a069aeca24a305820d7ed09f443a249edaa00ee"}
{"reference_id": "MP016:p0021:LREF06", "page_key": "MP016:p0021", "statement_zh": "泵两侧压力通过两侧真空/压力表监测；工况稳定且不再变化后可拆表，不表示必须拆除。", "relation": "diagnosed_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 58, "text": "Druckmessgerät an, um die Druckverhältnisse zu überwachen.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0075", "bbox": {"x0": 216.0, "top": 428.731, "x1": 367.576, "bottom": 435.731}}, {"start": 0, "end": 61, "text": "Sobald der Prozess läuft (und sich nicht mehr ändert), können", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0076", "bbox": {"x0": 216.0, "top": 437.131, "x1": 365.972, "bottom": 444.131}}, {"start": 0, "end": 29, "text": "diese wieder abgebaut werden.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0078", "bbox": {"x0": 216.0, "top": 445.531, "x1": 292.992, "bottom": 452.531}}], "source_page_sha256": "8d114e8e3112ef85392a16ec6a069aeca24a305820d7ed09f443a249edaa00ee"}
{"reference_id": "MP016:p0021:LREF07", "page_key": "MP016:p0021", "statement_zh": "泵吸入侧堵塞的过滤器导致汽蚀。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 51, "text": "Pumpe. Ein verstopfter Filter führt zur Kavitation.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP016:p0021:b0082", "bbox": {"x0": 216.0, "top": 465.211, "x1": 334.389, "bottom": 472.211}}], "source_page_sha256": "8d114e8e3112ef85392a16ec6a069aeca24a305820d7ed09f443a249edaa00ee"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0017:LREF01", "page_key": "MP018:p0017", "statement_zh": "泵脂润滑轴承：若此前使用另一类型润滑脂，补充润滑前必须冲洗出轴承室全部旧脂。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "All old grease must be flushed out from the bearing chambers before lubricating, if another type of grease", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0002", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 97.44, "x1": 544.116, "bottom": 108.36}}, {"start": 0, "end": 14, "text": "has been used.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0003", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 109.92, "x1": 124.548, "bottom": 120.84}}], "source_page_sha256": "e72facaa9313ae2bf057bef73ea7d2827775c5d304762cfe42b9c5053b89c3a4"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0017:LREF02", "page_key": "MP018:p0017", "statement_zh": "Model FS：违背Fina Lithium 2R替代限制可能引起轴承过早失效；与推力轴承油混合的适用情境必须保留。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 104, "text": "other greases for Fina Lithium 2R grease is not recommended due to some mixing of grease with the oil in", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0026", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 443.81, "x1": 544.149, "bottom": 454.73}}, {"start": 0, "end": 73, "text": "WARNING!! Failure to observe this may cause premature bearing failure and", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0029", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 494.09, "x1": 544.07, "bottom": 505.01}}], "source_page_sha256": "e72facaa9313ae2bf057bef73ea7d2827775c5d304762cfe42b9c5053b89c3a4"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0017:LREF03", "page_key": "MP018:p0017", "statement_zh": "Model FS油润滑球面滚子推力轴承：投入运行前检查油中水分。", "relation": "inspected_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "drained out. Oil must be added prior to initial startup. Before placing pump into operation, check oil for", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0034", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 581.45, "x1": 543.854, "bottom": 592.37}}, {"start": 0, "end": 68, "text": "presence of moisture. If present, clean the bearing and replace oil.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0035", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 593.93, "x1": 370.934, "bottom": 604.85}}], "source_page_sha256": "e72facaa9313ae2bf057bef73ea7d2827775c5d304762cfe42b9c5053b89c3a4"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0017:LREF04", "page_key": "MP018:p0017", "statement_zh": "Model FS油润滑推力轴承：运行前检查发现油中有水分时清洁轴承。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 68, "text": "presence of moisture. If present, clean the bearing and replace oil.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0035", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 593.93, "x1": 370.934, "bottom": 604.85}}], "source_page_sha256": "e72facaa9313ae2bf057bef73ea7d2827775c5d304762cfe42b9c5053b89c3a4"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0017:LREF05", "page_key": "MP018:p0017", "statement_zh": "Model FS油润滑推力轴承：运行前检查发现油中有水分时更换油；油应Fina GL-5140，替代需向工厂咨询。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 68, "text": "presence of moisture. If present, clean the bearing and replace oil.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0035", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 593.93, "x1": 370.934, "bottom": 604.85}}, {"start": 0, "end": 104, "text": "Oil for spherical roller thrust bearing on the pump should be Fina GL-5140. If substitution for this oil", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0036", "bbox": {"x0": 85.584, "top": 618.92, "x1": 544.778, "bottom": 629.84}}], "source_page_sha256": "e72facaa9313ae2bf057bef73ea7d2827775c5d304762cfe42b9c5053b89c3a4"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0017:LREF06", "page_key": "MP018:p0017", "statement_zh": "Model FS油润滑推力轴承使用不合适油可能造成轴承过早失效。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 71, "text": "WARNING ! ! Use of improper oil can cause premature bearing failure and", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0038", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 656.72, "x1": 544.395, "bottom": 667.64}}], "source_page_sha256": "e72facaa9313ae2bf057bef73ea7d2827775c5d304762cfe42b9c5053b89c3a4"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0017:LREF07", "page_key": "MP018:p0017", "statement_zh": "标准Model FS（除另有规定）：Trico Optomatic Oiler可显示油损失，不把自动补油当人工维护。", "relation": "diagnosed_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 111, "text": "make-up oil if the oil level is the thrust bearing should drop, and also give an indication of any loss of oil.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0017:b0042", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 719.116, "x1": 544.038, "bottom": 730.036}}], "source_page_sha256": "e72facaa9313ae2bf057bef73ea7d2827775c5d304762cfe42b9c5053b89c3a4"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF01", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "在轴承箱润滑不足或润滑剂含污物/水分时运行泵，会损害泵性能。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 86, "text": "operate pump if sufficient lubricant is not present in bearing housing or if lubricant", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0002", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 98.52, "x1": 544.093, "bottom": 109.44}}, {"start": 0, "end": 83, "text": "is contaminated with dirt or moisture. Operation of the unit under these conditions", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0003", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 111.0, "x1": 544.028, "bottom": 121.92}}, {"start": 0, "end": 68, "text": "will lead to impaired pump performance and possible bearing failure.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0004", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 123.48, "x1": 544.549, "bottom": 134.4}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF02", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "在轴承箱润滑不足或润滑剂含污物/水分时运行泵，可能造成轴承失效。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 83, "text": "is contaminated with dirt or moisture. Operation of the unit under these conditions", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0003", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 111.0, "x1": 544.028, "bottom": 121.92}}, {"start": 0, "end": 68, "text": "will lead to impaired pump performance and possible bearing failure.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0004", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 123.48, "x1": 544.549, "bottom": 134.4}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF03", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "泵在润滑剂过多时运行会使轴承过热。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 80, "text": "operate pump with excessive amount of lubricant. Such action will cause bearings", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0005", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 135.96, "x1": 544.17, "bottom": 146.88}}, {"start": 0, "end": 12, "text": "to overheat.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0006", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 148.44, "x1": 544.05, "bottom": 159.36}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF04", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "混用不同润滑脂或油会损害泵轴承。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 83, "text": "to overheat. Mixing of different greases or oils and use of the wrong grease or oil", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0006", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 148.44, "x1": 544.05, "bottom": 159.36}}, {"start": 0, "end": 25, "text": "will damage the bearings.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0007", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 160.92, "x1": 281.544, "bottom": 171.84}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF05", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "使用错误润滑脂或油会损害泵轴承。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 83, "text": "to overheat. Mixing of different greases or oils and use of the wrong grease or oil", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0006", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 148.44, "x1": 544.05, "bottom": 159.36}}, {"start": 0, "end": 25, "text": "will damage the bearings.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0007", "bbox": {"x0": 157.58, "top": 160.92, "x1": 281.544, "bottom": 171.84}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF06", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F脂润滑轴承：启动前检查润滑剂。", "relation": "inspected_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 99, "text": "lubricant should be checked before starting. If moisture is present, bearings should be cleaned and", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0012", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 273.63, "x1": 544.104, "bottom": 284.55}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF07", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F：启动前发现润滑剂含水时应清洁轴承，清洁不推荐使用氯化溶剂。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 99, "text": "lubricant should be checked before starting. If moisture is present, bearings should be cleaned and", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0012", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 273.63, "x1": 544.104, "bottom": 284.55}}, {"start": 0, "end": 51, "text": "of any kind is not recommended in bearing cleaning.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0015", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 311.07, "x1": 302.483, "bottom": 321.99}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF08", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F：启动前发现润滑剂含水时，在轴承清洁后加脂。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 99, "text": "lubricant should be checked before starting. If moisture is present, bearings should be cleaned and", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0012", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 273.63, "x1": 544.104, "bottom": 284.55}}, {"start": 0, "end": 15, "text": "grease applied.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0013", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 286.11, "x1": 543.756, "bottom": 297.03}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF09", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F润滑频次按运行和安装地区大气条件确定，不从本页推断具体周期。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 92, "text": "Operating conditions and atmospheric conditions existing in the area of installation must be", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0016", "bbox": {"x0": 85.584, "top": 336.03, "x1": 543.918, "bottom": 346.95}}, {"start": 0, "end": 63, "text": "considered when determining how often lubrication is necessary.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0017", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 348.51, "x1": 543.745, "bottom": 359.43}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF10", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F：有利工况且不需频繁润滑时，脂入口配堵头，仅润滑时换成注脂接头。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "operating under favorable conditions that do not warrant frequent lubrication, the grease inlets should be", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0018", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 360.99, "x1": 543.906, "bottom": 371.91}}, {"start": 0, "end": 83, "text": "equipped with plugs that are replaced with grease fittings only during lubrication.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0019", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 373.47, "x1": 436.991, "bottom": 384.39}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF11", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F润滑前根据实际装配图确认轴承类型和位置，仅由有经验维护人员润滑。", "relation": "inspected_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 99, "text": "Allow only experienced maintenance personnel to lubricate this unit. Before attempting to lubricate", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0020", "bbox": {"x0": 85.584, "top": 398.43, "x1": 544.687, "bottom": 409.35}}, {"start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "this unit, refer to your specific assembly drawing to determine the specific type and location of bearings", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0021", "bbox": {"x0": 49.56, "top": 410.91, "x1": 543.843, "bottom": 421.83}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF12", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F润滑程序步骤1：有经验人员先清洁注脂及排放堵头周围设备外表。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 68, "text": "1. Clean the exterior of the unit around the grease and drain plugs.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0024", "bbox": {"x0": 85.584, "top": 473.33, "x1": 418.191, "bottom": 484.25}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF13", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F润滑程序步骤2：完成周围清洁后移除排放堵头。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 94, "text": "2. Remove the drain plugs and if grease holes are plugged, remove the plugs and install grease", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0025", "bbox": {"x0": 85.584, "top": 498.29, "x1": 544.23, "bottom": 509.21}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF14", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F润滑程序步骤2：如脂孔封堵，移除堵头并装注脂接头；保持步骤前置清洁。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 94, "text": "2. Remove the drain plugs and if grease holes are plugged, remove the plugs and install grease", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0025", "bbox": {"x0": 85.584, "top": 498.29, "x1": 544.23, "bottom": 509.21}}, {"start": 0, "end": 24, "text": "fittings in their place.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0026", "bbox": {"x0": 108.14, "top": 510.77, "x1": 207.807, "bottom": 521.69}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF15", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F润滑程序步骤3：完成步骤1/2后缓慢注入表II推荐脂，不得过量。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 83, "text": "3. Slowly introduce recommended grease, per Table II into the bearings. DO NOT over", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0027", "bbox": {"x0": 85.584, "top": 535.73, "x1": 544.409, "bottom": 546.65}}, {"start": 0, "end": 80, "text": "lubricate. Churning of the grease may result in harmful overheating of bearings.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0028", "bbox": {"x0": 108.14, "top": 548.21, "x1": 491.596, "bottom": 559.13}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF16", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F润滑中，润滑脂搅动可能导致有害轴承过热。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 80, "text": "lubricate. Churning of the grease may result in harmful overheating of bearings.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0028", "bbox": {"x0": 108.14, "top": 548.21, "x1": 491.596, "bottom": 559.13}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF17", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F步骤4：先运行约15分钟排出轴承室多余压力，再擦净泄压孔和脂接头周围润滑脂并装回泄压塞；同一部位收尾按组合动作计。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 95, "text": "4. Before replacing the relief plug, operate the unit for approximately 15 minutes to expel any", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0029", "bbox": {"x0": 85.584, "top": 573.17, "x1": 544.263, "bottom": 584.09}}, {"start": 0, "end": 90, "text": "excess pressure from the bearing chambers. Wipe off all grease from around relief hole and", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0030", "bbox": {"x0": 108.14, "top": 585.65, "x1": 544.228, "bottom": 596.57}}, {"start": 0, "end": 37, "text": "grease fittings. Replace relief plug.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0031", "bbox": {"x0": 108.14, "top": 598.16, "x1": 276.089, "bottom": 609.08}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP018:p0015:LREF18", "page_key": "MP018:p0015", "statement_zh": "Model F步骤5：正常工况且不需频繁润滑时，润滑结束把脂接头换回堵头以防过量润滑。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "5. If the unit is being operated under normal conditions, and does not require frequent", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0032", "bbox": {"x0": 85.584, "top": 623.12, "x1": 543.75, "bottom": 634.04}}, {"start": 0, "end": 86, "text": "lubrication, replace grease fittings with plugs as a precaution against personnel over", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP018:p0015:b0033", "bbox": {"x0": 108.14, "top": 635.6, "x1": 544.577, "bottom": 646.52}}], "source_page_sha256": "58eadd527dda4fbe0d4fe7537a5f8456cd90c52a263e5155b1e719a77bfe0a77"}
{"reference_id": "MP021:p0011:LREF01", "page_key": "MP021:p0011", "statement_zh": "卸下修理的安全阀应装回相同位置，调节螺钉盖始终朝吸入侧。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 59, "text": "is removed for repairs be sure to replace in same position.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0004", "bbox": {"x0": 54.0, "top": 64.026, "x1": 285.588, "bottom": 73.026}}, {"start": 0, "end": 58, "text": "Relief valve adjusting screw cap must always point towards", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0006", "bbox": {"x0": 54.0, "top": 74.776, "x1": 290.079, "bottom": 83.776}}], "source_page_sha256": "7b03c082cc14f7061c6f469a6e8755c28c3290f3f9246215219dbb0e25ea15e6"}
{"reference_id": "MP021:p0011:LREF02", "page_key": "MP021:p0011", "statement_zh": "如果泵旋转方向反转，拆下安全阀并调头重装。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 58, "text": "suction side of pump. If pump rotation is reversed, remove", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0008", "bbox": {"x0": 54.0, "top": 85.526, "x1": 285.597, "bottom": 94.526}}, {"start": 0, "end": 34, "text": "relief valve and turn end for end.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0009", "bbox": {"x0": 54.0, "top": 96.276, "x1": 183.069, "bottom": 105.276}}], "source_page_sha256": "7b03c082cc14f7061c6f469a6e8755c28c3290f3f9246215219dbb0e25ea15e6"}
{"reference_id": "MP021:p0011:LREF03", "page_key": "MP021:p0011", "statement_zh": "安装新弹簧或改变安全阀出厂压力设定时，步骤1小心取下螺钉阀盖并松锁紧螺母。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 63, "text": "If a new spring is installed or if pressure setting of pressure", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0013", "bbox": {"x0": 54.0, "top": 131.726, "x1": 288.594, "bottom": 140.726}}, {"start": 0, "end": 59, "text": "1. Carefully remove valve cap which covers adjusting screw.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0019", "bbox": {"x0": 54.0, "top": 167.576, "x1": 297.098, "bottom": 177.035}}, {"start": 0, "end": 54, "text": "Loosen locknut which locks adjusting screw so pressure", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0021", "bbox": {"x0": 67.5, "top": 181.926, "x1": 290.583, "bottom": 190.926}}], "source_page_sha256": "7b03c082cc14f7061c6f469a6e8755c28c3290f3f9246215219dbb0e25ea15e6"}
{"reference_id": "MP021:p0011:LREF04", "page_key": "MP021:p0011", "statement_zh": "上述压力调整程序步骤2，在排出管安装压力表用于实际调整；作为压力测量方法，仪器本身不等于检查动作。", "relation": "diagnosed_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 56, "text": "2. Install a pressure gauge in discharge line for actual", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0025", "bbox": {"x0": 54.0, "top": 207.026, "x1": 270.594, "bottom": 216.485}}, {"start": 0, "end": 20, "text": "adjusting operation.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0027", "bbox": {"x0": 67.5, "top": 217.776, "x1": 146.043, "bottom": 226.776}}], "source_page_sha256": "7b03c082cc14f7061c6f469a6e8755c28c3290f3f9246215219dbb0e25ea15e6"}
{"reference_id": "MP021:p0011:LREF05", "page_key": "MP021:p0011", "statement_zh": "安全阀压力调整步骤3：顺时针向内转调节螺钉升压，逆时针向外转降压；保持新弹簧/改变出厂设定的上下文与步骤1/2。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 49, "text": "Turn adjusting screw CW (in) to increase pressure", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0029", "bbox": {"x0": 67.5, "top": 232.126, "x1": 267.216, "bottom": 241.126}}, {"start": 0, "end": 35, "text": "and CCW (out) to decrease pressure.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0032", "bbox": {"x0": 67.5, "top": 242.876, "x1": 272.079, "bottom": 251.876}}], "source_page_sha256": "7b03c082cc14f7061c6f469a6e8755c28c3290f3f9246215219dbb0e25ea15e6"}
{"reference_id": "MP021:p0011:LREF06", "page_key": "MP021:p0011", "statement_zh": "压力调整时，在表后关闭排出管且泵仍运行会令泵内温度迅速升高；必须限时。", "relation": "causes", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 58, "text": "4. Close the discharge line at a point beyond the pressure", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0038", "bbox": {"x0": 54.0, "top": 278.726, "x1": 287.613, "bottom": 288.185}}, {"start": 0, "end": 54, "text": "operated at this condition. The temperature inside the", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0042", "bbox": {"x0": 67.5, "top": 300.226, "x1": 280.457, "bottom": 309.226}}, {"start": 0, "end": 56, "text": "pump will rise rapidly. Gauge will show maximum pressure", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0044", "bbox": {"x0": 67.5, "top": 310.976, "x1": 299.894, "bottom": 319.976}}], "source_page_sha256": "7b03c082cc14f7061c6f469a6e8755c28c3290f3f9246215219dbb0e25ea15e6"}
{"reference_id": "MP021:p0011:LREF07", "page_key": "MP021:p0011", "statement_zh": "压力调整步骤4：表后关闭排出管且泵运行时，压力表显示该阀允许的最大压力；限时以防升温。", "relation": "diagnosed_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 56, "text": "pump will rise rapidly. Gauge will show maximum pressure", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0044", "bbox": {"x0": 67.5, "top": 310.976, "x1": 299.894, "bottom": 319.976}}, {"start": 0, "end": 49, "text": "that valve will allow while pump is in operation.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0046", "bbox": {"x0": 67.5, "top": 321.726, "x1": 253.062, "bottom": 330.726}}], "source_page_sha256": "7b03c082cc14f7061c6f469a6e8755c28c3290f3f9246215219dbb0e25ea15e6"}
{"reference_id": "MP021:p0011:LREF08", "page_key": "MP021:p0011", "statement_zh": "上述安全阀调压步骤5：压力设定完成后，紧固锁紧螺母并装回盖垫片和阀盖。", "relation": "maintained_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 56, "text": "5. Once pressure is set, tighten locknut and replace cap", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0049", "bbox": {"x0": 54.0, "top": 336.076, "x1": 279.603, "bottom": 345.535}}, {"start": 0, "end": 21, "text": "gasket and valve cap.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0051", "bbox": {"x0": 67.5, "top": 346.826, "x1": 154.548, "bottom": 355.826}}], "source_page_sha256": "7b03c082cc14f7061c6f469a6e8755c28c3290f3f9246215219dbb0e25ea15e6"}
{"reference_id": "MP021:p0011:LREF09", "page_key": "MP021:p0011", "statement_zh": "附录一般安装指导：安装前按泵型号检查接口位置，各型号结构并非全部适用。", "relation": "inspected_by", "evaluation_channel": "core", "source_witnesses": [{"start": 0, "end": 57, "text": "3. Port Arrangement - since the pumps have different port", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0035", "bbox": {"x0": 328.5, "top": 259.767, "x1": 566.595, "bottom": 269.226}}, {"start": 0, "end": 50, "text": "arrangements depending on the model, port location", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0037", "bbox": {"x0": 342.0, "top": 270.517, "x1": 550.611, "bottom": 279.517}}, {"start": 0, "end": 51, "text": "should be checked before starting the installation.", "kind": "native_block_subspan", "block_id": "MP021:p0011:b0039", "bbox": {"x0": 342.0, "top": 281.267, "x1": 557.472, "bottom": 290.267}}], "source_page_sha256": "7b03c082cc14f7061c6f469a6e8755c28c3290f3f9246215219dbb0e25ea15e6"}
